\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Young believers who had discovered the gospel with fresh clarity were sent to visit churches as part of their ministry training.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 What happened next surprised all of us.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Some were welcomed.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 But many were not.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 They were told they spoke too much about grace.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 That the gospel they shared sounded dangerous.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 That it did not emphasize effort strongly enough.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Some were quietly warned.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Others were openly rejected.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 A few were eventually pushed out of their churches entirely.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 None of them had changed the message of Scripture.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 They had simply begun to take it seriously.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Those events forced a question I could no longer ignore.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 If the gospel is truly the power of God unto salvation, why does it sometimes feel unwelcome in the very place that claims to proclaim it?}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 That question began a journey.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The pages that follow are the record of that journey.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
