\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 She was laughing while trying not to spill the coffee she was pouring.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 \'93I\rquote m serious,\'94 Adri\'e1n said. \'93If you burn this one too I\rquote m switching caf\'e9s.\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 \'93You say that every week.\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 \'93And yet here I am.\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 She slid the cup across the counter.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Adri\'e1n lifted it, inspected it carefully, then nodded.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
