\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The four men never noticed me.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 They were too engaged with one another.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 At first their conversations seemed ordinary. Friends meeting after their travels, sharing stories about churches they had visited.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 But slowly the conversation changed.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 What began as casual observations became an investigation.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 One by one the churches were discussed.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Corinth.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Galatia.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Ephesus.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Laodicea.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 At first the differences between them seemed obvious.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Corinth was openly troubled.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Galatia was intensely serious.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Ephesus was doctrinally careful.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Laodicea appeared strong and successful.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 But as the conversation continued, something unexpected began to appear.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Underneath the differences, the same problem kept surfacing.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Carnality.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Not always obvious.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Not always scandalous.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Sometimes loud.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Sometimes respectable.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 But always present.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 At first the men tried to understand it through experience.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 They spoke about churches.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 About leadership.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 About discipline.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 About unity.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 About success.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 About failure.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 They repeated phrases most of us have heard before.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 \'93Where do you draw the line?\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 \'93I believe in grace, but people will abuse it.\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 \'93We must protect unity.\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 \'93Grace is good, but you can\rquote t be without the law.\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 \'93We just need to try harder.\'94}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 All of it sounded familiar.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Because most churches have built their lives around managing carnality.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Systems are created.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Rules are added.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Pressure is applied.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The flesh is restrained, corrected, warned, and disciplined.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 But rarely understood.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 That was the turning point of the conversation.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 When the men finally asked a simple question:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 What does the Bible actually mean by \'93flesh\'94?}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 That question led them back to Scripture.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 And once they began observing carefully, the picture became clearer.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Carnality is not limited to immorality.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Corinth proved that.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 But neither is carnality limited to moral looseness.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Galatia proved that.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Carnality can also appear in devotion to doctrine.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Ephesus showed that.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 And it can flourish inside religious success.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Laodicea demonstrated that.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Different expressions.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The same root.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The flesh.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 For a time the conversation seemed stuck there.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 If carnality could appear in so many forms, what hope was there for the church?}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 That is when the cross entered the discussion.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Not as a slogan.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Not as a theological statement.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 But as the decisive act of God.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The cross does not negotiate with the flesh.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 It does not reform it.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 It does not manage it.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The cross condemns it.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Those who belong to Christ Jesus have crucified the flesh with its passions and desires.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Once that truth became clear, many other passages suddenly made sense.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The cross confronts carnality.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The cross disarms it.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The cross protects the believer from it.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 And grace, flowing from the cross, produces something entirely different.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Not managed carnality.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 New life.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 That is the difference the men slowly began to see.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The gospel is not merely forgiveness for failure.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 It is the power of God unto salvation.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 A salvation that reaches into daily life.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 A salvation that produces fruit.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 A salvation that leads believers to walk by the Spirit rather than constantly struggle with the flesh.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 For years many churches have assumed that carnality is simply part of the Christian experience.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Something to manage.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Something to restrain.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Something to keep under control.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 But the cross tells a different story.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The flesh has already been judged.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 And grace has already been given.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The question is no longer whether the cross has spoken.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The question is whether we believe what it has said.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The four men eventually left the caf\'e9 that evening.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 Their investigation had not produced a new system.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 It had not produced a better strategy.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 But it had revealed something far more important.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The answer had been present all along.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 The cross.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 And the grace that flows from it.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 That grace has made all the difference.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
\par 
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid12213631 So why do we keep trying to manage what God has already judged?}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid9372636 
